WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.188 --> 00:00:20.329
Riley and Quinn hurried over to where all the riders were gathering.

2
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:25.560
It was time for Coach Adams to announce the new Blue Demons team.

3
00:00:25.561 --> 00:00:31.115
The coach stood holding a clipboard. He congratulated all the riders.

4
00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:36.050
"Everyone had great rides today, despite the surprise track change.

5
00:00:36.051 --> 00:00:38.108
You should all be proud of yourselves.

6
00:00:38.109 --> 00:00:45.543
Now, as you know, the fastest two boys and girls in each division will be invited to join this year's Blue Demons team.

7
00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:51.621
Will the following riders, please come forward? For the junior division . . ."

8
00:00:51.622 --> 00:00:59.700
After Coach Adams announced Riley's name, the first thing Riley heard was Jordan cheering loudly.

9
00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:03.107
"Yay! Go, Riley!"

10
00:01:03.108 --> 00:01:11.356
Mr. and Mrs. Clark looked happy too, clapping like mad as Riley made her way through the crowd.

11
00:01:11.357 --> 00:01:16.130
"I did it! I'm a Blue Demon!" Riley thought.

12
00:01:16.131 --> 00:01:25.013
Thrilled, she took her place beside Coach Adams as Delaney handed her an official Blue Demons jersey.

13
00:01:25.014 --> 00:01:31.995
Riley was so excited, she didn't realize that the next name Coach Adams called wasn't Quinn's name.

14
00:01:31.996 --> 00:01:38.248
She didn't think about Quinn until a younger girl named Shavetta appeared beside Riley.

15
00:01:38.249 --> 00:01:44.493
"I'm a Blue Demon! I'm a Blue Demon!" Shavetta yelled with excitement.

16
00:01:44.494 --> 00:01:52.065
Riley looked back toward where Quinn had been standing. But the other girl was no longer there.

17
00:01:52.066 --> 00:02:01.480
After all the new team members had been announced, the Blue Demons team gathered together, high-fiving one another.

18
00:02:01.481 --> 00:02:05.254
"Welcome to the Blue Demons!" Coach Adams said.

19
00:02:05.255 --> 00:02:13.056
"To celebrate our new team, we're going to Tony's Pizza Place for lunch. Everyone, bring your families and meet us there!"

20
00:02:13.057 --> 00:02:20.547
Riley knew that her family would join the team. They'd gone to the pizza party each year that Jordan had made the team.

21
00:02:20.548 --> 00:02:32.282
Sure enough, Mr. and Mrs. Clark were already packing up the folding chairs, and Jordan was heading to the parking lot with some other Blue Demons.

22
00:02:32.283 --> 00:02:38.281
Riley went over to Coach Adams. "That's too bad about Quinn," she said.

23
00:02:38.282 --> 00:02:42.857
"She's a good rider. I thought she'd make the team."

24
00:02:42.858 --> 00:02:48.610
"I think her overall time was about three seconds behind yours," the coach replied.

25
00:02:48.611 --> 00:02:52.269
"Shavetta Jackson had the best overall time."

26
00:02:52.270 --> 00:03:00.931
"Oh . . . Thanks, Coach." As Riley walked away, she realized that she felt disappointed.

27
00:03:00.932 --> 00:03:06.270
"But why should you feel bad that Quinn hadn't made the team?" she asked herself.

28
00:03:06.271 --> 00:03:12.928
Quinn hadn't been very nice to Riley, and Riley had fought really hard to win a spot on the Blue Demons.

29
00:03:12.929 --> 00:03:18.069
But Quinn had worked hard too. Somehow it just didn't seem fair.

30
00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:22.575
Riley suddenly spied Quinn sitting on a curb in the parking area.

31
00:03:22.576 --> 00:03:31.892
She was alone, still smeared with mud, her duffel bag beside her. Her bike lay in the grass, spattered with dirt.

32
00:03:31.893 --> 00:03:43.889
"So much for that shiny bike," Riley thought. She walked over to Quinn. "Sorry you didn't make the team," she said softly.

33
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:48.229
Quinn glanced up. She looked as if she'd been crying.

34
00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:54.123
She wiped her nose with the back of her sleeve, leaving a smear of dirt on her face.

35
00:03:54.124 --> 00:04:01.694
"It's my fault," she muttered. "Like I said before, great bike but dumb rider."

36
00:04:01.695 --> 00:04:05.429
"I bet you can make the team next year," Riley said.

37
00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.207
Quinn shrugged. "Maybe."

38
00:04:08.208 --> 00:04:11.960
Just then a tall shadow blocked the sun.

39
00:04:11.961 --> 00:04:18.792
Coach Hopewell, the head coach from the Racing Raptors, stood there, looking down at them.

40
00:04:18.793 --> 00:04:25.855
"That was a great ride, Quinn," he said. "I was very impressed with your speed and grit on the track."

41
00:04:25.856 --> 00:04:31.678
"Thanks, Coach." Quinn brightened a little. "I really did do my best out there today."

42
00:04:31.679 --> 00:04:37.010
She glanced quickly at Riley. "Though I made some dumb mistakes too."

43
00:04:37.011 --> 00:04:41.682
"I just had a chat with Coach Adams about you," Coach Hopewell went on.

44
00:04:41.683 --> 00:04:46.402
"Coach Adams is very disappointed that you didn't qualify for the Blue Demons.

45
00:04:46.403 --> 00:04:53.583
So, when I suggested that I offer you a spot on the Racing Raptors, he thought it was a good idea."

46
00:04:53.584 --> 00:05:01.822
"What?" Quinn's eyes grew round. "Did you just say I can join the Racing Raptors?"

47
00:05:01.823 --> 00:05:09.496
The coach smiled. "That's what I said. One of my junior riders is moving, and I have an open slot.

48
00:05:09.497 --> 00:05:13.723
That is, if you're interested in joining the team."

49
00:05:13.724 --> 00:05:19.738
"Of course I am!" Quinn cried. "Thank you so much, Coach!"

50
00:05:19.739 --> 00:05:29.477
Coach Hopewell dug in his bag and pulled out a black-and-gold jersey. "Welcome to the team," he said.

51
00:05:29.478 --> 00:05:33.625
"Practice is on this track next week. I'll see you then."

52
00:05:33.626 --> 00:05:40.854
"Wow! Congratulations," Riley said as the coach left. "That was amazing!"

53
00:05:40.855 --> 00:05:46.363
"It sure was. I can't believe that just happened!" Quinn yelped.

54
00:05:46.364 --> 00:05:55.187
"You and your parents should come for pizza with us," Riley said. "Coach Adams won't mind, and you definitely need to celebrate."

55
00:05:55.188 --> 00:06:00.027
Quinn glanced away. "Nah," she said quickly.

56
00:06:00.028 --> 00:06:04.698
"My aunt is picking me up in a little while, and we have to go straight to her house."

57
00:06:04.699 --> 00:06:12.777
"Oh. Didn't your parents come to watch you ride?" For the first time Riley realized that Quinn's parents were nowhere around.

58
00:06:12.778 --> 00:06:18.101
From the look on Quinn's face, Riley was immediately sorry she'd said something.

59
00:06:18.102 --> 00:06:21.764
"My parents aren't here," Quinn said quickly.

60
00:06:21.765 --> 00:06:27.913
"My dad's away on business, and my mom's got stuff to do. She's usually pretty busy on the weekends."

61
00:06:27.914 --> 00:06:32.426
"Well, I still think you should celebrate," Riley said.

62
00:06:32.427 --> 00:06:37.574
"I have an idea—would your aunt let you come with my family?"

63
00:06:37.575 --> 00:06:44.843
"Uh . . ." Quinn hesitated. "Maybe," she said. "I'll text her now."

64
00:06:44.844 --> 00:06:49.165
Riley told her parents what was going on while Quinn texted her aunt.

65
00:06:49.166 --> 00:06:56.316
"My aunt said yes," Quinn said, running up to Riley and her family. "If you guys can drive me home afterward?"

66
00:06:56.317 --> 00:07:03.799
"Not a problem," Mr. Clark said. "Let's get going, both of you, or there won't be any pepperoni pizza left."

67
00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:10.544
"I don't get it, Riley," Quinn said as they crossed the parking lot together.

68
00:07:10.545 --> 00:07:16.551
"I haven't been very nice to you. So why are you being so nice to me?"

69
00:07:16.552 --> 00:07:21.121
Riley smiled. "I'm not sure," she admitted.

70
00:07:21.122 --> 00:07:27.627
"But I do know something: the Racing Raptors and the Blue Demons race each other all the time.

71
00:07:27.628 --> 00:07:33.633
And my new mission in life is to smoke you every time!"

72
00:07:33.634 --> 00:07:41.204
Quinn grinned. "Well, be prepared for disappointment. You will soon come to fear me—I promise you that."

73
00:07:41.205 --> 00:07:54.353
"Oh yeah?" Riley laughed. "Haven't you heard? I eat fear for breakfast!"
